                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEME UND VERFAHREN ZUR ERMÖGLICHUNG VON KLINISCHER NACHRICHTENÜBERMITTLUNG IN EINER NETZWERKUMGEBUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS POUR FACILITER LA MESSAGERIE CLINIQUE DANS UN ENVIRONNEMENT DE RÉSEAU</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS AND METHODS FOR FACILITATING CLINICAL MESSAGING IN A NETWORK ENVIRONMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Various techniques for facilitating communication with and across a clinical environment and a cloud environment are described. These techniques may include converting pump messages into standardized dataset messages, merging the messages into a cache, transmitting the messages to a cloud server, detecting network outages, clearing an outbound queue, detecting missing messages, authenticating a connectivity adapter for cloud access, providing a segmented data structure, among others.</p>
            </abstract>
